# Test fixtures are tracked even when they mimic a local-only artifact. A fixture
# that reproduces a run folder has to contain the same dot-prefixed files a real
# run writes, and the patterns above would otherwise swallow it: `git add` on an
# ignored path is a silent no-op, so the fixture stays behind, the suite passes
# locally, and CI fails on a clean checkout with nothing to read.
!skills/ultracode-goal/scripts/tests/fixtures/**/.decision-log.md
!skills/ultracode-goal/scripts/tests/fixtures/**/.memlog.md

# graphify knowledge-graph output (generated locally, not shipped)
graphify-out

